{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","舞动生息"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Vibrant Dance"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对范围内友军施加强化，并进行治疗。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Fay enhances and heals allies within range."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，为面前3格扇形范围内的友军恢复-300% − 30% ATK的生命值，并在该区域内施加元气魔法，使其中的友军提升12%攻击力，持续8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Fay selects a direction and casts vitality magic to frontal allies within a 3-tile arc, restoring -300% − 30% ATK HP and increasing their ATK by 12% for 8s."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":103,"end":109,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":98,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","持续时间延长至9秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases effect duration to 9s."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使范围内的友军提升14%攻击力。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK of allies within range by 14%."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","范围内的友军还会提升15点攻击速度。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK SPD of allies within range by 15."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","持续时间延长至10秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases effect duration to 10s."],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","宝石愈疗"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Healing Gemstones"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名友军施加持续治疗。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Fay heals 1 ally over time."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的1名友方英雄施加治愈法术，使该英雄在接下来的4 + 1.5秒内每秒恢复50% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Fay heals the weakest allied hero, restoring 50% ATK HP per second for 4 + 1.5s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":1,"end":5,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":40,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":45,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒恢复量提升至55% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases HP restored per second to 55% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":36,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒恢复量提升至60% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases HP restored per second to 60% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":36,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每秒恢复量提升至65% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases HP restored per second to 65% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":36,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","璀璨绽放"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Blinding Light"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射一枚宝石，对范围内敌人造成伤害，对友军产生治疗。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Fay smacks a gem, damaging enemies and healing allies in range."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","向最近的一名敌人发射一枚宝石，命中后产生爆炸，并对半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成150% + 15% ATK伤害，并对范围内的所有友军恢复150% + 15% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Fay smacks a gem at an enemy. She causes an explosion when the skill hits, dealing 150% + 15% ATK damage to adjacent enemies and restoring 150% + 15% ATK HP to all allies within range."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":87,"end":93,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":143,"end":149,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":83,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":139,"end":153,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至155% + 15% ATK，治疗效果提升至155% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increase damage to 155% + 15% ATK and HP restored to 155% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":57,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":53,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","宝石会根据主目标的伤害类型而变化成不同形态，并对受影响目标产生不同的额外效果：若主目标造成物理伤害则变为红宝石，降低敌人10%护甲并提升友军10%护甲，持续5秒；若主目标造成魔法伤害则变为蓝宝石，降低敌人10%魔抗并提升友军10%魔抗，持续5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","The gem has 2 forms and 2 different buffs. It becomes a ruby if the target deals physical damage, reducing enemies' Phys DEF by 10% and increasing allies' Phys DEF by 10% for 5s. It becomes a Sapphire if the target deals magic damage, reducing enemies' Magic DEF by 10% and increasing allies' Magic DEF by 10% for 5s."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK，治疗效果提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increase damage to 160% + 15% ATK and HP restored to 160% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":57,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":53,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身生命值。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases HP during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升17%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases HP by 17% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升23%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases HP by 23% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升29%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases HP by 29% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","华丽开场"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Grand Entrance"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","开局时对身前的友军施加单体的强化和持续治疗效果。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Fay enhances and heals the ally deployed on the tile in front of herself when the battle starts."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，立即对布阵在自己身前一格上的友方英雄施加“舞动生息”和“宝石愈疗”技能的持续增益效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Fay grants the buffs of Vibrant Dance and Healing Gemstones on the allied hero deployed 1 tile in front when a battle starts."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontonehex"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":88,"end":103,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontonehex"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","同时还会使该友方英雄提高15点受愈，持续至战斗结束。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Also increases the allied hero's Vitality by 15 till the end of a battle."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该友方英雄获得的受愈提高至20点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the allied hero's Vitality by 20."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该友方英雄获得的受愈提高至25点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the allied hero's Vitality by 25."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“宝石愈疗”持续期间，目标生命值过低时会获得一次强力治疗。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Fay grants a low-HP ally powerful healing once when Healing Gemstones takes effect."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“宝石愈疗”施加的治愈法术持续期间，目标生命值百分比首次低于50%时，会立即获得一次强力治疗，恢复自身200% ATK的生命值。每次释放该技能，最多只能触发一次强力治疗的效果。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When an ally's HP ratio drops below 50% for the first time during Healing Gemstones takes effect, Fay heals the ally by 200% ATK HP. This effect can only be triggered once each time this skill is used."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":120,"end":128,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","拉拉指挥棒"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Cheering Baton"]]}